        StaticBook("Flicka' Da Wrist", "Gwyn Tahn'thill", "Its not your fault I'm a bitch, Ima monster :3\nand a beast and I feast when I conquer. But I'm alone on the throne, all these witches. I came this way, all this way, to say-ay!\nI swear to god man,everything in life is old. And the only thing changing is the price of gold, but when I come back believe me I'll be twice as bold.\nYou a stupid hoe", ""),
        StaticBook("Fool's Sword", "Bell Sano", "1550, 14th of the\nGreat Harvest\n\nFool's Sword\n\nLevi Shatar\nThe Fool's Sword is a steel longsword, which has been snapped into two seperate pieces. The tip is stained to the point of rust. Badly beaten and worn out, it was passed down to Levi Shatar by Richard Revlis.\nRevlis was a respected military figure in Dunamis, given the title of Marshall. During the time period that he was in command, the Oren Civil War was taking place, so it's assumed that the sword was forged around\nthe year 1500 or earlier. Seeing many battles, Richard Revlis passed the weapon down to his son, Danis Revlis, and then him down to Shatar. Upon obtaining the sword, Shatar pierced his own stomach with the sword in battle, causing it\nto snap into two pieces. His wounds were healed, but the sword remains broken. He came in contact with the sword about eleven years prior to him donating it.\nIt is unknown if Richard forged it himself, or if he simply used it in the Civil War.", ""),
        StaticBook("For Alavera", "Vas Umbra-Vincrute", "Alavera, your love is pure.\n\nWhen my heart is sick, you are the cure.\n\nAlavera, your gaze makes me smile\n\nOh I do so hope these feelings last a long while.\nIn five years, six years, twenty or thirty,\n\nI hope you stay with me throughout this whole journey.\n\nI hope we have kids, I hope they find love\n\nAnd I pray that we someday watch over them from the heavens above.\nI write this poem, thinking only of you.\n\nI think of us on the alter, saying much more than \"I do.\"\n\nI do hope my vows make your heart race.\n\nI simply cannot wait to see the look on your face!\nYou'll blush and you'll laugh,\n\nAnd you will certainly shout \"Oh dammit all Vas!\"\n\nThen we will kiss and hug and I hope that in life,\n\nI forever remain your husband, and you forever remain my wife.", ""),
        StaticBook("For Aleksandra.", "Stefjan Kovachev", "I long for the joy and the peace in your heart to stay within it, for they are unparalleled, and have spreaded to my heart.\n\nI hope that you don't ever feel lonesome, or saddened, for I will stand by your side as you have standed besides mine -\nuntil my last day.\n  I want to confess that you are the fuel that drives me forward, and that you are the most gorgeous woman in my eyes.\n\nI long to start my days besides you, and end them by your side.\nBut above all, my love, I long for our love to never fade, and on the contrary, grow larger as the years go by.\n\nI would not change who you are, or what you could be, for I love you for what you are, the queen of my heart.\nWhen my eyes meet yours, or I hold your hand, or I kiss you, I feel as if we were truly kindred spirits.\n\nEndless love, Aleksandra Abrielle\n\nForever yours,\nStefjan Aleksandr\n[!] A flaming heart surrounded by a golden ring with the words \"My heart is yours.\" written upon it is drawn on this page.", ""),
