        StaticBook("Pirate Insults", "§bNemir", "§0\n§0\n§0\n§0         How to§0\n§0          Insult§0\n§0           Like a§0\n§0             Pirate§0\n§0-------------------          Written by:§0\n§0   Nemir Valnelis Ward\n\nSo you want to talk like a pirate?  Well you've found the right book!  After reading this, you'll surely knock your enemies down wish just your tongue.§0\n§0\n\nStarter words:§0\n§0- Idiotic§0\n§0- Parrot-loving§0\n§0- Mumbling§0\n§0 - Blathering§0\n§0- Bleating§0\n§0- Sheep-brained§0\n§0- Pin-headed§0\n§0- Pig-breathed§0\n§0- Cricket-sized§0\n\nMiddle words:§0\n§0- Seaweed-slurping§0\n§0- Duck-billed§0\n§0- Pus-faced§0\n§0- Toothless§0\n§0- Knuckle-dragging§0\n§0- Cross-eyed§0\n§0- Scurvy-ridden§0\n§0- Clam-tongued§0\n§0- Yellow-bellied§0\n\nLast words:§0\n§0- Whale-fart§0\n§0- Cow-pie§0\n§0- Sack o’maggots§0\n§0- Cabin boy§0\n§0- Swabber§0\n§0- Waste of skin§0\n§0- Bag of vomit§0\n§0- Anchor-head§0\n§0- Piece of filth§0", ""),
