        StaticBook("MyDaddyLovesMe", "§bAshur", "I love my daddy, I love my daddy\n\nI love my daddy, and I know he loves me\n\nHe makes me happy, he makes me happy\n\nHe makes me happy, happy as can be\n\nI love my daddy, I love my daddy\n\nI love my daddy, and I know he loves me\n\nHe makes me happy, he makes me happy\n\nHe makes me happy, and I know he loves me\n\nHe helps me learn things, he helps me learn things\n\nHe helps me learn things, he teaches me right\n\nHe gives me hugs, he gives me hugs\n\nHe gives me hugs, and tucks me in at night\n\nBut daddy is gone, now, daddy is gone\n\nDaddy is gone, now, A day long since gone\n\nAnd now I have found you, and taken my light\n\nYou'll be my new daddy, and tuck me in at night\n\n-================-\n\nThis poem was sung in the Library of Dragur by a spectre, that of a child.\n\nAshur Uilloson and a High Elf named Nyna were in attendance. Lights were snuffed out.\n-================-", ""),
