        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "===================        Hochspitze§0\n§0         Register§0\n§0            of§0\n§0        Residents§0\n§0===================§0\n§0\n§0            by§0\n§0\n§0     Aylwin Blaxton§0\n§0      §0\n§0       Chancellor§0\n§0            of§0\n§0       Hochspitze\n\n1. H.R.H Prince               Frederick Augustus     Horen-Pruessen.§0\n§0   -----------------    Lord of§0\n§0   Hochspitze Castle§0\n§0   -----------------    Residence:§0\n§0   §0The Lord's Keep§0\n§0   -----------------    Workplace:§0\n§0   H.R.H's Office.\n\n2. Lady Elisa Roswell§0\n§0\n§0   -----------------    Courtier and §0\n§0   Extended Family.§0\n§0   -----------------    Residence:§0\n§0\n§0   None allocated.§0\n§0\n§0   The Lord's Keep?\n\n3. Lady Alyssa§0\n§0   Adelheid Amador§0\n§0   -----------------    Architect & Niece of    Prince Frederick.§0\n§0   -----------------§0\n§0   Residence:§0\n§0\n§0   First Floor, Room 3.\n\n4. Heir?\n\n5. Spare?\n\n6. Aylwin Blaxton of        Mondstadt§0\n§0   -----------------    Chancellor of the§0\n§0   Castle of Hochspitze    -----------------    Residence:§0\n§0   None Allocated§0\n§0   -----------------    Workplace:§0\n§0   Chancellor's Office\n\n7. Ser Nikola Karlowicz    §0\n§0   -----------------    Constable of§0\n§0   Hochspitze Castle§0\n§0   -----------------    Residence:§0\n§0   First Floor, Room 1.§0\n§0   -----------------    Workplace:§0\n§0   Constable's Office.\n\n8. Floris Van Loden§0\n§0  §0\n§0   -----------------    Steward-Seneschal     of Hochspitze            Castle§0\n§0   -----------------    Residence:§0\n§0   None Allocated§0\n§0   -----------------    Workplace:§0\n§0   Hochspitze Library\n\n9. Maester Aldred§0\n§0\n§0   -----------------    Maester for §0\n§0   Hochspitze Castle§0\n§0   -----------------    Residence:§0\n§0   None Allocated§0\n§0   -----------------    Workplace:§0\n§0   Hochspitze §0\n§0   Infirmary\n\n10. Blundermore§0\n§0     Patrick Wind-Raker     ---------------