        StaticBook("Legion Logbook 1", "§bCommander Gorum Frostbeard", "Name Maximus §0\n§0Rank IronBreaker§0\n§0Time in 10.30§0\n§0TIme out 12.30§0\n§0Important notes: none§0\n§0\n§0HONOUR GIVEN\n\nname: Gaius Quintius§0\n§0rank: stoneguard§0\n§0time in: 10:30§0\n§0time out: 12:30§0\n§0important notes:§0\n§0few visitors§0\n§0\n§0HONOUR GIVEN\n\nName: Bomreg Ireheart§0\n§0Rank: Grunt§0\n§0Time in: 12:45§0\n§0Timeout: 1:45§0\n§0\n§0HONOUR GIVEN\n\nRank: Pridebearer§0\n§0Name: Garrond Frostbeard§0\n§0Time in: 3:30pm (GMT+13)§0\n§0Time out: 6:30pm§0\n§0\n§0Notes: N/A§0\n§0\n§0HONOR GIVEN\n\nLongbeard§0\n§0Maximus Meridio§0\n§0TIme in 20:00 gmt+1§0\n§0Time out 21:00 gmt+1§0\n§0None§0\n§0Honor GIVEN\n\nName: §0\n§0Korhaz Grandaxe§0\n§0\n§0Rank:§0\n§0Grunt§0\n§0\n§0Time in:§0\n§00500 (AEST)§0\n§0\n§0Time out:§0\n§00800 (AEST)§0\n§0\n§0HONOR GIVEN\n\nName:§0\n§0Korhaz Grandaxe§0\n§0\n§0Rank:§0\n§0Grunt§0\n§0\n§0Time in:§0\n§00000 (AEST)§0\n§0\n§0Time out:§0\n§00300 (AEST)§0\n§0\n§0HONOR GIVEN\n\nName:§0\n§0Korhaz Grandaxe§0\n§0\n§0Rank:§0\n§0Grunt§0\n§0\n§0Time in:§0\n§00000 (AEST)§0\n§0\n§0Time out:§0\n§00300 (AEST)§0\n§0\n§0HONOUR GIVEN\n\nMAximus§0\n§0italian beast§0\n§0the whole day§0\n§0Lefty shot me with his bow while riding his horse (not toni)§0\n§0\n§0HONOUR GIVEN\n\nName:§0\n§0Korhaz Grandaxe§0\n§0\n§0Rank:§0\n§0Grunt§0\n§0\n§0Time in:§0\n§00000 (AEST)§0\n§0\n§0Time out:§0\n§00300 (AEST)§0\n§0\n§0HONOR GIVEN\n\nName:§0\n§0Korhaz Grandaxe§0\n§0\n§0Rank:§0\n§0Grunt§0\n§0\n§0Time in:§0\n§00000 (AEST)§0\n§0\n§0Time out:§0\n§00300 (AEST)§0\n§0\n§0HONOUR GIVEN\n\nMaximus Meridio§0\n§0Longbeard§0\n§0time in: 19:30 (gmt+1)§0\n§0time out : 20:30§0\n§0None§0\n§0\n§0HONOUR GIVEN\n\nGaius Quintius §0\n§0Ironbreaker §0\n§019:30§0\n§020:30§0\n§0none§0\n§0\n§0HONOUR GIVEN\n\nName:§0\n§0Korhaz Grandaxe§0\n§0\n§0Rank:§0\n§0Stoneguard§0\n§0\n§0Time in:§0\n§00000§0 (AEST)§0\n§0\n§0Time out:§0\n§00300 (AEST)§0\n§0\n§0HONOR GIVEN\n\nName:§0\n§0Korhaz Grandaxe§0\n§0\n§0Rank:§0\n§0Ston