        StaticBook("Oz e Nak", "§bOya Silvervein", "Dear Einar§0\n§0\n§0For your hospitality I left ye a gift of a dwarven sword forged for a once important dwed who govened Kaz'Ulrah as the warden and the mountain scrouge armor which is dwarven armor found in the ruins of old jornheim\n\nNarvak Nak§0\n§0\n§0-Oya Stormfist-§0\n§0\n§0[!]§0\n§0\n§0A stormfist seal is printed on the page", ""),
