        StaticBook("Point Shop", "§bJaya Jayamen", "Points Shop§0\n§0\n§0armor§0\n§0Tin§0\n§0 1 defence §0\n§05 hp §0\n§01 point.§0\n§0\n§0Bronze §0\n§02 defense §0\n§010 hp§0\n§0 4 points§0\n\nIron§0\n§0 3 defense§0\n§0 15 hp §0\n§08 points§0\n§0\n§0Steel §0\n§04 defense§0\n§0 20 hp §0\n§014 points§0\n\nMithril §0\n§05 defense §0\n§025 hp §0\n§021 points§0\n§0\n§0Adamantine§0\n§0 6 defence §0\n§030 hp §0\n§029 points§0\n\nweapons§0\n§0Tin §0\n§02 attack§0\n§02 Points§0\n§03 HP§0\n§0\n§0Bronze §0\n§03 attack §0\n§05 points§0\n§06 HP§0\n\nIron §0\n§04 attack§0\n§09 points§0\n§09 HP§0\n§0\n§0Steel §0\n§05 attack§0\n§015 points§0\n§012 HP§0\n\nMithril§0\n§0 6 attack §0\n§022 points§0\n§015 HP§0\n§0\n§0Adamantine§0\n§0 7 attack§0\n§030 points§0\n§018 HP§0\n\nStrength potion ((pink dye))§0\n§0 attack increases by 4 for a round§0\n§0 5 points§0\n§0\n§0Swiftness potion ((purple dye))§0\n§0defense increases by 4 for a round.§0\n§0 5 points§0\n\nSmokepot ((red dye))§0\n§0 your opponent loses two of his turns. §0\n§010 points§0\n§0\n§0Ultra strength potion ((yellow dye))§0\n§0 increases attack by 8 for a round§0\n§010 points§0\n\nUltra swiftness potion ((white dye))§0\n§0increases defense by 8 for a round. §0\n§010 points§0\n§0\n§0Strength brace ((grey dye))§0\n§0 increases attack by 2 passively §0\n§020 points§0\n\nMetal charm ((orange dye))§0\n§0 increases defense by 2 passively§0\n§0 20 points§0\n\nAbilities§0\n§0\n§0Brace for impact ((pink block))§0\n§0 for the round you take half damage rounded up. §0\n§0Takes 3 rounds to recover.§0\n§0 Can be used on the other persons turn. 30 points to learn§0\n\nAdrenaline ((orange block))§0\n§0you do double damage for the round.§0\n§0 30 points to learn. §0\n§0Takes 3 rounds to recover.§0", ""),
