        StaticBook("The OOTB Test", "§bJaya Jayamen", "The Out of the Box§0\n§0           Test§0\n§0\n§0    ~By Jaya Jayamen§0\n§0\n§0\n§0Instructions:§0\n§0This quiz is made to test your ability to see answers that are hard to figure out. Think outside the box!§0\n§0A Prize to anyone who turns it in completed.\n\n1. If I am you and you are he then who are you if he is me? §0\n§0(a) He §0\n§0(b) Me §0\n§0(c) You §0\n§0(d) Jerry Louis? §0\n\n2. How many enclosed spaces are in one circle? §0\n§0(a) 1 §0\n§0(b) 2 §0\n§0(c) 3 §0\n§0(d) 4 §0\n\n3. If red minus 2 = yellow and red plus 3 = green then what is red plus 1? §0\n§0(a) 5 §0\n§0(b) Orange §0\n§0(c) 1 §0\n§0(d) Purple §0\n\n4. Sassalass §0\n§0(a) Sasperella §0\n§0(b) That would be rude §0\n§0(c) Root beer? §0\n§0(d) Ssalassas §0\n\n5. Forgetting order of operations in math, What would be the answer to this. §0\n§02+7*10-200+300*2.5/25 = §0\n§0(a) 25 §0\n§0(b) 19 §0\n§0(c) 11 §0\n§0(d) 546.5§0\n\n6. Which word is the same as ZWOMIWHO §0\n§0(a) MIOWWHZO §0\n§0(b) OHWIMOWZ §0\n§0(c) OHMIWOMZ §0\n§0(d) ZWOMIWHO §0\n\n7. Directions §0\n§0Left = right §0\n§0right = down §0\n§0Down = up §0\n§0up = Right §0\n§0down = Left §0\n§0Left = Down §0\n§0Right = Up §0\n§0Which word that means a direction has nothing equal to it? §0\n\n8. How do you think you did on this test? §0\n§0(a) Perfect §0\n§0(b) Well §0\n§0(c) Poor §0\n§0(d) Horrible §0\n\nTurn this in with the test completed to Jaya Jayamen for a prize.", ""),
