        StaticBook("The Lucky Ones", "§bChrysanthos", "The Lucky Ones§0\n§0\n§0And others§0\n§0===================§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n§0A collections of thoughts§0\n§0\n§0\n§0By Chrysanthos\n\nWords Between You and I§0\n§0===================Bitter words, off the serpent's tongue.§0\n§0Offer deadly surfeit; but a keener sting.§0\n§0The serpent coils ensnare me and you.§0\n§0Till we subside to our impending doom.§0\n§0\n§0offer deadly surfeit but a keener sting\n\nDo not fret as for we have won.§0\n§0Hermes staff has burned thy serpent's tongue.§0\n§0Brashful eyes and Ignorant minds.§0\n§0Yes thats you and I.§0\n§0\n§0Do not fret as for we have won.§0\n§0\n\nOh, but I do fret.§0\n§0Their is no antidote for corrupted minds.§0\n§0All do God is near, §0\n§0But yet the Devil is right here.§0\n§0\n§0Oh, but I do fret.§0\n§0\n§0No remedy for memory.§0\n§0No shine, but I’ve gone blind§0\n§0While every time I rest my eyes,\n\nI'm scared that you won't be waiting on the other side.§0\n§0===================§0\n§0\n\nLuck§0\n§0===================§0\n§0\n§0Every now and then, the stars align§0\n§0far better than your average wine §0\n§0\n§0What luck?§0\n§0\n§0Is it unseen forces now?§0\n§0and not our holy vow?§0\n\nwhat luck?§0\n§0\n§0Could it be that you and me are the lucky ones?§0\n§0Despite this fadeing sun?§0\n§0\n§0What luck?§0\n§0===================\n\nFloating Places§0\n§0===================§0\n§0\n§0What have we done,§0\n§0do we not fit in?§0\n§0we are just like you,§0\n§0only a little different.§0\n§0\n§0Send us to floating places§0\n§0\n§0I don't want to burn tonight. I don't want to see my demise.\n\nSend us to floating places so we can escape your fire.§0\n§0===================", ""),
